---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="box skills" aria-label="Areas of focus">
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="strategy" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.25rem" />
		<h2>AI systems</h2>
		<p>Applied NLP, agentic workflows and automation designed to achieve real outcome.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="terminal-window" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.25rem" />
		<h2>Research tooling</h2>
		<p>Python-first tools that compress the path from a question to an interpretable result.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="trophy" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.25rem" />
		<h2>Systematic trading</h2>
		<p>Evidence-led strategy research, portfolio construction and live market execution.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.box { border: 1px solid var(--gray-800); border-radius: 1.25rem; padding: 1.5rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gray-999) 88%, transparent); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
	.skills { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3rem; }
	.skills h2 { font-size: var(--text-lg); }
	.skills p { color: var(--gray-400); }
	@media (min-width: 50em) { .box { padding: 2.5rem; } .skills { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 4rem; } .skills h2 { font-size: var(--text-xl); } }
</style>
